198
00:07:40.010 --> 00:07:41.910 line:15%
Because all their whole,

199
00:07:41.910 --> 00:07:43.810 line:15%
and it has to be rooted in liberation,

200
00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:47.140
because their whole objective with me

201
00:07:47.140 --> 00:07:50.400
was to make sure that I was fed, that I was cared for,

202
00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:53.520
and that I was more liberated than they were coming up.

203
00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:56.693
And there's nothing else that I could,

204
00:07:58.671 --> 00:08:01.500
I have nothing else to credit to my success

205
00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:06.401
